# Short 4, "The Space page" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Chamber playing (the most echo, deep
# feedback, one chord held), FX for the Space page, and its four knobs one at a time, each turn slow (single
# steps, 50 ms apart) from a bar's downbeat: Echo taken dry, Reverb up into the plate (heard best with the echo
# out of the way) and back, Echo back up, Echo time through 1/4 and 1/2 and back to 1/8., Feedback past 100%
# (it swells) over the Break and back. The take starts at bar 32, so the dry echo falls in a Full phrase (in
# the Break before it, Echo at 0 left near silence between the chords). Each `bar` prints the film's time
# there (the cue sheet for the labels).
turn PRESET 1 5
wait 30
expect piece 1
bar 32
wav 13-short-space.wav
film 13-short-space.film
bar 32 CHAMBER playing (A Aeolian, 118)
bar 34 FX: the Space page
tap FX
bar 35 KNOB 1, Echo 70 down to 0: dry
turn K1 -70 50
expect par8 0
bar 37 KNOB 4, Reverb 45 up to 100: into the plate
turn K4 55 50
expect par10 100
bar 39 Reverb back to 45
turn K4 -55 50
expect par10 45
bar 41 KNOB 1 again, Echo 0 up to 70: wet
turn K1 70 50
expect par8 70
bar 43 KNOB 2, Echo time 1/8. to 1/4
turn K2 1 150
expect par9 2
bar 45 Echo time 1/2
turn K2 2 150
expect par9 4
bar 47 Echo time back to 1/8.
turn K2 -3 150
expect par9 1
bar 48 KNOB 3, Feedback up to the top: it swells
turn K3 25 50
expect par11 100
bar 51 Feedback back
turn K3 -25 50
expect par11 75
bar 56 END
filmstop
wavstop
